# The import check's baseline. See contracts/baseline.md in #544's spec folder,
# and the "Imports and the Context Map" section of AGENTS.md.
#
# A placement line, `<file> <package>`, puts a module that hasn't moved into its
# context's package yet in that context. A violation line, `<file> -> <file>`,
# names two modules whose import breaks the map today. The check fails on a line
# that matches nothing, and a line added here waits for a person to run
# `wfctl arch approve-imports`.

# Placements
_arch.py arch
_archive.py session
_bob_settings.py install
_bundle.py install
_change.py evidence
_completion.py evidence
